            <ArticleTitle>[Study of fatty acid composition of cell membranes during the use of soya oil in diet therapy of patients with cardiovascular diseases].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>39-42</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Anti-atherogenic diet supplemented with 20 g soy oil has been analyzed in patients with coronary artery disease and high blood pressure. The vegetable PUFA omega-3 and omega-6 from soy oil have been found to change physical, biological and chemical property of membranes; improved clinical condition as well as to modify erythrocyte membrane fatty acid composition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
